{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02B930","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"哥斯达黎加的铁路建设接连遭遇艰难工程。听说死了很多人，施工还一度中断。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":"JPN_INTERRUPTION_DETAIL_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"这里也是其中之一。好不容易爬过陡峭地形，才在一片开阔地建起了车库。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":"AUX_DEPOT_AND_OPEN_GROUND_DETAILS_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"于是这里就有了这个名字……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"<R=绞刑架,El Cadalso>吗。品味可算不上好。不过照这种情况，建设资金居然还能撑下去。","cn_control_tokens":"<R=绞刑架,El Cadalso>","cn_utf8_bytes":114,"review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED_LATIN_READING"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"其实后来确实不够了。不过听说多亏香蕉，工程最终才得以完成。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"是吃香蕉补充体力，坚持把工程干完的吗？香蕉的营养价值确实……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":"JPN_SNAKE_MISUNDERSTANDING_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"不是不是。是为了挤出修铁路的钱，他们开始出口香蕉。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":"JPN_FUNDING_CAUSALITY_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"原来是这样……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"结果这一招大获成功！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":"AUX_SEMANTIC_DRIFT_CORRECTED"},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"铁路的经营者不但完成了工程，后来甚至还开办了香蕉贸易公司。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":"AUX_TRADING_COMPANY_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"这就是哥斯达黎加香蕉种植的开端。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":"ENG_ROW_MISALIGNMENT_IGNORED"}]}